Source of the Motanka Stack packages: motanka-stack-libs,
motanka-stack-hyprland, motanka-stack-tools and the motanka-stack
metapackage. All files install under /opt/motanka.

The upstream components are listed in stack/components.tsv (imported into
this source package by build-imports). stack/fetch-sources downloads and
verifies them; test/vm/build passes them to packaging/build.sh as
dpkg-source 3.0 (quilt) orig-<component> tarballs. debian/control is
generated per suite from debian/control.in, and the noble build gets GCC 16
from the Ubuntu toolchain PPA (sbuild-repos), at build time only.
